Cristina Medeiros/CMBH
Um operador de produção que apresentou 88 ate</description>  <ns1:content url="https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/LtF1qBImqnJiWkYL72maNHcF-Rs=/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2025/J/n/L8QBbtSNiG3MHqPATIEQ/biblia-camara-escolas.jpg" medium="image" />    <category>G1</category> <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 08:00:00 -0000</pubDate>  </item>  </channel>  </rss>